00:11:01.249 --> 00:11:03.916
and making that YouTube
video on it as a review.

00:11:03.916 --> 00:11:05.464
I really really appreciate support

00:11:05.464 --> 00:11:07.531
and I'm so glad that you love the book.

00:11:07.531 --> 00:11:09.048
So thank you guys so much for watching.

00:11:09.048 --> 00:11:10.461
I believe in you.

00:11:10.461 --> 00:11:12.319
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:11:12.319 --> 00:11:15.738
and whatever your one word is, much love.

00:11:15.738 --> 00:11:17.238
I'll see you soon.

